1	box	Progress on your sword can be tracked via the display on screen. You can track which tool you need to use via the completion bar.
1	line	Kovac	This is very impoten... important...
1	line	Kovac	The preform needs to be within a certain heat range to work properly.
1	line	Kovac	If you use the wrong tool...
1	line	Kovac	or tool at wrong heat, we damage the preform quality.
1	line	Kovac	A sword with low quality is bad...
1	line	Kovac	Means less giants will want it, so Kovac give less for it.
1	line	Kovac	If you damage a preform too much, it will become junk and Kovac will have to throw it away...
1	line	Kovac	but this first attent... attempt, so do not worry about quality too much.
1	line	Kovac	You use trip hammer first. Trip hammer need preform to be quite hot.
1	box	The temperature of the preform is tracked via the temperature bar.
1	box	To work a preform with a tool, the temperature needs to be within the matched temperature range, or you'll damage the preform.
1	box	Any damage to the preform will lower its quality, tracked via the quality bar. If there's no quality left in the preform it becomes unworkable, and must be throw away.
